WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
In language modeling,

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.260
autoregressive models like GPT thrive on a
universal token interface.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.930
Recent work extends this idea to vision,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.600
treating images and annotations as visual sentences.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.270
But the leading large vision model needs over three
billion parameters and roughly four

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.940
hundred billion visual tokens drawn from more than
a billion images.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.610
That scale is expensive and impractical for edge
deployment.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.280
Worse,

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.950
the visual world is long-tailed: some tasks like
segmentation have abundant data while

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:36.620
others like pose estimation are starved,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.290
and training on the raw mixture leaves the model
unable to learn the rare tasks at all.
